{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, עֲדָא","hw":"עֲדָא","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. pass on, away (</strong>𝔗 for Heb. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָבַר</span>, Syriac; v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, עָדָה\" href=\"/BDB,_עָדָה\", dir=\"rtl\">I. עָדָה</a> (rare, late)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pe.</strong>  Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲדָת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:27\" href=\"/Daniel.3.27\">Dn 3:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:28\" href=\"/Daniel.4.28\">4:28</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶעְדֵּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:14\" href=\"/Daniel.7.14\">7:14</a>, 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּעְדֵּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:9\" href=\"/Daniel.6.9\">6:9</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>pass on, over</em>, c. ב pers. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:27\" href=\"/Daniel.3.27\">Dn 3:27</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>pass away</em>, of kingdom <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:28\" href=\"/Daniel.4.28\">4:28</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> pers.), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:14\" href=\"/Daniel.7.14\">7:14</a>; of law <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:9\" href=\"/Daniel.6.9\">6:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:13\" href=\"/Daniel.6.13\">13</a>.<br><strong>Haph.</strong>  <em>take away</em> (so Egyptian Aramaic S-C<sup>G 35</sup>): Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶעְדִּיו</span>, acc. rei, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:20\" href=\"/Daniel.5.20\">Dn 5:20</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> pers.), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:12\" href=\"/Daniel.7.12\">7:12</a>; Impf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהַעְדּוֹן</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:26\" href=\"/Daniel.7.26\">26</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְהַעְדֵּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:21\" href=\"/Daniel.2.21\">2:21</a> <em>remove, depose</em> kings, of God.","next":"BDB Aramaic, עַד²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, עַד"}